+Prefer auth direct Writer route or plain JSON in WRITER_QUEUE. Up to 25 homog reqs/file. ENRICH: {"action":"batch","requestId":"<RUN_ID>-B01","requests":[{"action":"ruling","ruling":{"requestId":"<RUN_ID>-B01-R01","primaryId":"V2I-...","kind":"ENRICH","actor":"CHATGPT","fields":{}}}]}. Upper-case keys. Complete https URLs. Never send COMPANY/TITLE/LOCATION/REQ/BUCKET/DISPOSITION/PRIMARY_ID as ENRICH fields.
