+An independent unresolved original Writer request remains a separate reconciliation obligation. Job presence never proves that request COMPLETE and never clears its fence or authorizes replay. Keep its original request identity and independent RESULT/COMPLETE/exact-effect checks. Evidence-only helpers return EXISTING_MATCH_CANDIDATE with available proof for the existing coordinator to account; they do not mutate queues or reservations or claim canonical completion. If fresh canonical access is unavailable, reuse saved evidence and flag coordinator canonical recheck instead of requesting credentials.
