+Regular rolling 3-hour window plus inherited unfinished windows, regular window first. Whole mailbox, no category/inbox/label restriction. Sender families: LinkedIn jobalerts-noreply@linkedin.com/jobs-noreply@linkedin.com; Indeed donotreply@jobalert.indeed.com; Glassdoor noreply@glassdoor.com/info@glassdoor.com; ZipRecruiter phil@ziprecruiter.com/alerts@ziprecruiter.com; Lensa jobalert@lensa.com/lensa24@lensa.com/aggregated@lensa.com; Ladders jobs@my.theladders.com; employer/recruiter alerts. Paginate and record each family/page. Classify every sender in scope; open unclassified senders mentioning jobs/roles/openings/hiring/careers/requisitions/apps, add valid sources immediately, read their alerts in this run. Preserve inventory (sender, family, first-seen date, alert count).
